{"seq":2,"slug":"software-engineering","title":"软件工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"软件工程-简介\">软件工程 简介</h1><p>软件工程关注的不是&quot;如何写出一段能运行的代码&quot;，而是&quot;如何在不断变化的需求下，持续交付可靠、可维护的软件系统&quot;。当代码规模从几百行增长到几十万行，当开发者从一个人变成几十人的团队，纯粹的编程技巧就不够了——你需要一套系统化的方法来管理复杂性。</p>\n<p>这门学科诞生于二十世纪六十年代的&quot;软件危机&quot;：项目超期、预算失控、交付的系统漏洞百出。半个多世纪以来，从瀑布模型到敏捷开发，从手工测试到持续集成，软件工程不断演进出更务实的实践。它的核心信念是：好的软件不仅仅靠天才程序员，更依赖好的过程、好的设计和好的协作。</p>\n<p>本学习空间围绕软件从构思到运维的完整生命周期，组织为四个章节。<strong>第一章 软件过程</strong> 梳理主流的开发模型和方法论，从经典的生命周期模型到现代的敏捷与 DevOps 实践，帮助你理解软件项目的节奏和纪律。<strong>第二章 软件设计</strong> 聚焦于如何做出好的技术决策，包括设计模式的运用、架构风格的选择以及 API 的设计原则。<strong>第三章 软件质量</strong> 探讨如何在快速迭代中守住质量底线，涵盖测试策略、代码审查和持续集成等关键实践。<strong>第四章 软件项目管理</strong> 讨论需求分析、估算规划和团队协作，因为再精妙的技术方案也需要合理的项目管理才能落地。</p>\n<p>软件工程最好的学习方式是参与真实项目。建议在阅读每个章节时，尝试将其中的方法应用到自己正在进行的编码实践中，哪怕只是一个个人小项目，也能让抽象的理论变得鲜活起来。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"software-process","title":"软件过程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-process","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"software-lifecycle","title":"大学软件工程 — 软件生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-process/software-lifecycle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"agile-development","title":"大学软件工程 — 敏捷开发方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-process/agile-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"requirements-engineering","title":"大学软件工程 — 需求工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-process/requirements-engineering"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"software-design","title":"软件设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-patterns","title":"大学软件工程 — 设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-design/design-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"software-architecture","title":"大学软件工程 — 软件架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-design/software-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"uml-modeling","title":"大学软件工程 — UML 建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-design/uml-modeling"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"software-quality","title":"软件质量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-quality","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"software-testing","title":"大学软件工程 — 软件测试","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-quality/software-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-review-refactoring","title":"大学软件工程 — 代码审查与重构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-quality/code-review-refactoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-integration","title":"大学软件工程 — 持续集成与持续交付","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-quality/continuous-integration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"project-management","title":"软件项目管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/project-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"project-planning","title":"大学软件工程 — 项目计划与估算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/project-management/project-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-management","title":"大学软件工程 — 风险管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/project-management/risk-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"team-collaboration","title":"大学软件工程 — 团队协作与沟通","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/project-management/team-collaboration"}]}]}